          "text": "{\"questions\":[{\"scenario\":\"Locating the subway entrance\",\"prompt\":\"Where is the subway entrance?\",\"context\":\"Ask the station staff politely for directions.\",\"spokenPrompt\":\"How would you ask where the subway entrance is?\",\"choices\":[{\"hangul\":\"지하철 입구가 어디예요?\",\"romanization\":\"jihacheol ipgu ga eodiyeoyo?\"},{\"hangul\":\"지하철 표를 어디서 사요?\",\"romanization\":\"jihacheol pyoreul eodiseo sayo?\"},{\"hangul\":\"전철 시간표 알려 주세요.\",\"romanization\":\"jeoncheol siganpyo allyeo juseyo.\"}],\"correctAnswerIndex\":0,\"translation\":\"Where is the subway entrance?\",\"explanation\":\"지하철 입구가 어디예요? is a common, polite way to ask for the entrance location.\",\"teachingPoint\":\"Where is the entrance? use 입구가 어디예요? to ask for location.\",\"explanationNarration\":\"Ask for the location of a place using -ga eodiyeoyo? and polite ending -yo.\"},{\"scenario\":\"Locating a ticket counter\",\"prompt\":\"Where can I buy a ticket for the subway?\",\"context\":\"Ask where to buy a ticket.\",\"spokenPrompt\":\"Where can I buy a subway ticket?\",\"choices\":[{\"hangul\":\"티켓은 어디에서 살 수 있어요?\",\"romanization\":\"tikes eun eodieseo sal su isseoyo?\"},{\"hangul\":\"표를 어디서 사요?\",\"romanization\":\"pyoreul eodiseo sayo?\"},{\"hangul\":\"역에서 표를 살 수 없어요.\",\"romanization\":\"yeokeseo pyoreul sal su eopseoyo.\"}],\"correctAnswerIndex\":1,\"translation\":\"Where can I buy a ticket?\",\"explanation\":\"표를 어디서 사요? asks for the ticket purchase location.\",\"teachingPoint\":\"표를 사다 = buy a ticket; 어디서 살 수 있어요 = where can I buy it.\",\"explanationNarration\":\"Use where-yeoseo to ask where something is sold or available.\"},{\"scenario\":\"Finding a platform\",\"prompt\":\"Which platform is for the next train to City Center?\",\"context\":\"Ask about the correct platform.\",\"spokenPrompt\":\"Which platform should I go to for the next train to City Center?\",\"choices\":[{\"hangul\":\"다음 열차는 도시센터로 가는 플랫폼이 어디예\",\"romanization\":\"da-eum yeolcha neun dosi senteoro ganeun peullatepom i eodiya?\"},{\"hangul\":\"다음 열차는 도시센터로 가나요?\",\"romanization\":\"da-eum yeolcha neun dosi senteoro ganayo?\"},{\"hangul\":\"도시센터로 가는 플랫폼이 몇 번호예요?\",\"romanization\":\"dosi senteoro ganeun peüllatpom i myeot beon-eyo?\"}],\"correctAnswerIndex\":0,\"translation\":\"Which platform is for City Center?\" ,\"explanation\":\"This asks for the correct platform number for a specific destination.\",\"teachingPoint\":\"Platform numbers are shown on signs; use 어느 플랫폼이요? for quick questions.\",\"explanationNarration\":\"Ask about the platform to avoid missing the train.\"},{\"scenario\":\"Checking train destination\",\"prompt\":\"Does this train go to Seoul Station?\",\"context\":\"Confirm train destination politely.\",\"spokenPrompt\":\"Does this train go to Seoul Station?\",\"choices\":[{\"hangul\":\"이 열차가 서울역으로 가나요?\",\"romanization\":\"i yeolchaga seouldyeog-euro ganayo?\"},{\"hangul\":\"서울역으로 가려면 어떻게 해요?\",\"romanization\":\"seouldyeog-euro garyeomyeon eotteoke haeyo?\"},{\"hangul\":\"서울역에 도착하나요?\",\"romanization\":\"seouldyeog-e dochakhanayo?\"}],\"correctAnswerIndex\":0,\"translation\":\"Does this train go to Seoul Station?\",\"explanation\":\"Ask whether the current train is bound for Seoul Station.\",\"teachingPoint\":\"Go to + destination to ask about final stop.\",\"explanationNarration\":\"Check the train’s final stop to confirm your destination.\"},{\"scenario\":\"Transfer information\",\"prompt\":\"Where should I transfer to reach my next point?\",\"context\":\"Ask for the transfer point politely.\",\"spokenPrompt\":\"Where should I transfer to reach my next destination?\",\"choices\":[{\"hangul\":\"다음 목적지로 가려면 어디에서 환승해요?\",\"romanization\":\"da-eum mokpogjiro garyeomyeon eodieseon hwanseonghaeyo?\"},{\"hangul\":\"다음 역에서 환승해요?\",\"romanization\":\"da-eum yeog eseo hwanseonghaeyo?\"},{\"hangul\":\"환승은 필요 없어요.\",\"romanization\":\"hwanseongeun piryoh eopseoyo.\"}],\"correctAnswerIndex\":0,\"translation\":\"Where should I transfer to reach my next destination?\",\"explanation\":\"This asks for the best transfer point for the next leg.\",\"teachingPoint\":\"환승 = transfer; 어떤 역에서 환승해요 = at which station do you transfer.\",\"explanationNarration\":\"Ask for the transfer point to continue your journey efficiently.\"}],\"bonus\":{\"scenario\":\"Final exit choice for a named place\",\"prompt\":\"Which exit should I take to reach City Hall?\",\"context\":\"Public transit with a named destination; final exit choice.\",\"spokenPrompt\":\"Which exit should I take to reach City Hall?\",\"choices\":[{\"hangul\":\"시청으로 가려면 어떤 출구로 가야 해요?\",\"romanization\":\"sicheong euro garyeomyeon eotteon chulgu ro gayahayo?\"},{\"hangul\":\"시청 방향으로 맞는 출구가 어디예요?\",\"romanization\":\"sicheong banghyangeun ano go chulgu gae?\"},{\"hangul\":\"시청으로 가는 가장 가까운 출구는 어디예요?\",\"romanization\":\"sicheongeo ganeun gakkaun chulgu neun eodiyeyo?\"}],\"correctAnswerIndex\":2,\"translation\":\"Which exit is closest to City Hall?\",\"explanation\":\"Exit choices can vary; choose the one closest to City Hall to save time.\",\"teachingPoint\":\"출구 = exit; 가장 가까운 출구 = the closest exit.\"}}"
